comments:
9287f7ca: ;
 ;Query the STATUS, DATE, and EVENT TRACKING information associated
 ;with the given TRANSCRIPT (#393) record.
 ;

830eb231: ;
 ;If the status is 'INCOMPLETE', check if the transcript is overdue based on
 ;the DATE DICTATED and the MAX DICTATION DAYS defined in EVENT TRACKING.
 ;If overdue, set DGJTFLAG and calculate the number of overdue days in DGJTDL.
 ;

7fd11e82: ;
 ;If the status is 'DICTATED', set DGJTFLAG (indicating overdue) and
 ;calculate the number of overdue days based on DATE DICTATED.
 ;

34ccf893: ;
 ;If the status is 'TRANSCRIBED', check if the transcript is overdue based on
 ;the DICTATED DATE/TIME and the MAX TRANSCRIPTION DAYS defined in EVENT TRACKING.
 ;If overdue, set DGJTFLAG and calculate the number of overdue days.
 ;

f7bc5aff: ;
 ;If there is a MAX SIGNATURE DAYS defined in EVENT TRACKING, and the status is 'SIGNED',
 ;check if the transcript is overdue based on the TRANSCRIBED DATE/TIME and MAX SIGNATURE DAYS.
 ;If overdue, set DGJTFLAG and calculate the number of overdue days.
 ;

7729c9c8: ;
 ;Calculate the number of days between the current date/time
 ;and the relevant date/time, and store it in DGJTDL.
 ;
